      "description": "Two opposing supports with the stone between them, each reaching inward past the stone's edge so the seat relief leaves a real groove. The geometry is complete and the structural behaviour is NOT MODELLED: no force, no spring-back, no retention claim. Professional review is required before this geometry means anything functional."
